{"question_text": {"স্পেশাল বিসিএস (স্বাস্থ্য) - লং কোর্স": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) Which of the following is an example of short chain carbohydrates?", "option1": "Starch", "option2": "Glucose", "option3": "Pectins", "option4": "Maltodextrins", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2696.jpg\" alt=\"\" />"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) Which of the following BMI is regarded as obese among south asians?", "option1": ">23", "option2": ">25", "option3": ">30", "option4": ">35", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2697.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1070\" height=\"411\" />"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) Cause of weight loss in adults due to impaired energy storage?", "option1": "Thyrotoxicosis ", "option2": "Addison disease ", "option3": "Cancer cachexia", "option4": "Diabetes mellitus ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2698.jpg\" alt=\"\" />"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) Complications of nasogastric tube feeding-", "option1": "Risk of tumour seeding", "option2": "Intestinal perforation", "option3": "Refeeding syndrome", "option4": "Pneumothorax ", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2700.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1028\" height=\"352\" />"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) Parameter that is monitored weekly in patients receiving parenteral nutrition in hospital?", "option1": "Electrolytes ", "option2": "Liver function test", "option3": "Cholesterol", "option4": "C-reactive protein", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2701.jpg\" alt=\"\" />"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) Water soluble vitamin is-", "option1": "Retinol", "option2": "Tocopherol", "option3": "Phylloquinone", "option4": "Cobalamin", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2702.jpg\" alt=\"\" />"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) Which vitamin is synthesised by bacteria in the colon?", "option1": "Vitamin K1", "option2": "Vitamin K2", "option3": "Vitamin D", "option4": "Vitamin E", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2704.jpg\" alt=\"\" />"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) Which of the following is not a function of Vitamin E?", "option1": "It prevents oxidation of polyunsaturated fatty acids in cell membranes by free radicals.", "option2": "It helps maintain cell membrane structure.", "option3": "It affects RNA synthesis and cell signalling", "option4": "It is involved in the anti inflammatory and immune systems.", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2705.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"962\" height=\"779\" />"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) Falsely elevated SpO2 is found in-", "option1": "Carboxyhaemoglobin", "option2": "Methaemoglobinaemia", "option3": "Severe tricuspid regurgitation", "option4": "Hyperbilirubinaemia", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2706.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1052\" height=\"366\" />"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) Central cause of chest pain-", "option1": "Pulmonary infarct", "option2": "Pulmonary embolus", "option3": "Pneumonia ", "option4": "Pneumothorax ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_2707.jpg\" alt=\"\" />"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) Non cardio respiratory cause of elevat